// input: after idr-tail-loops
// The IO loops that print the Mandelbrot set, mandel and mandelRow, return
// actions and call themselves inside them. Once idr-defunctionalize has made
// their closures sums over labels, and the matches on known labels are
// folded, they are self tail calls, which idr-tail-loops turns into loops,
// each carrying the world; as Idris does not prove them terminating, a loop
// carries idr.may_loop. A counted one becomes an scf.for. Other loops may
// come between.
// CHECK: scf.{{while|for}} {{.*}}!idr.world
// CHECK: idr.may_loop
// CHECK: scf.{{while|for}} {{.*}}!idr.world
// CHECK: idr.may_loop
